In fact, just the fact of successfully casting a spell (aka not seeing
"You fail to cast the spell correctly.") is enough to increment the
counter for enhancing spellcasting skills, and it adds the level of
the spell (e.g., force bolt will add 1 pt to the attack skills but
magic missile 2).


